        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Therefore, an automatic procedure for the installation of such a contract certificate is required: certificate provisioning. This procedure is supported by the charge protocol by offering the messages CertificateInstallationReq/Res. These messages transmit a contract certificate from a secondary actor (e.g. mobility provider) to the EV for installation and are secure by using encrypted communication. In order to enable certificate provisioning, activities which happen outside the charge protocol are required additionally. These activities are sketched in Figure H.13 and described in H.5.",
            "block_bbox": [
                67,
                243,
                1054,
                401
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
